<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on blue chip basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on blue chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co CV said on Tuesday it had launched 300 million American style warrants on a basket of four blue-chip property stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd		0.05  shares</p>
<p> Henderson Land Development Co Ltd   0.05  shares</p>
<p> New World Development Co Ltd	  0.075 shares</p>
<p> Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd	   0.075 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$15.44    PREMIUM	    14.23 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3123   GEARING	    5.2x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18.FEB.98   MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   SETTLEMENT DATE  08.APR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$16.25    LISTING DATE     09.APR.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
